## 6. Air travel

### AIR-01 — {{ t["AIR-01"] }}
All grades travel in economy class. G3 employees may travel in business class on flights with a scheduled duration of more than {{ limits.business_class_min_flight_hours }} hours.

### AIR-02 — {{ t["AIR-02"] }}
Flights should be booked at least {{ limits.advance_booking_days }} days in advance wherever practicable. Later bookings must include a reason.

## 7. GST and invoices

### GST-01 — {{ t["GST-01"] }}
Hotel and air travel invoices should carry the company GSTIN so that the company can evaluate input tax credit (ITC) eligibility.

### GST-02 — {{ t["GST-02"] }}
Input tax credit is not claimed on food and beverages, outdoor catering, or travel benefits extended to employees on vacation, which are blocked credits under Section 17(5) of the CGST Act, 2017.

### GST-03 — {{ t["GST-03"] }}
Hotel invoices where the room rate is ₹{{ "{:,}".format(limits.hotel_itc_review_threshold) }} or less per night are tagged for tax team review before any input tax credit is claimed.

